DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The iimmxxeessddhhcc driver provides support for the MMC/SD/SDIO controller inte‐
     grated in i.MX 6, i.MX 7 and i.MX 8 processors.

     The sdmmc(4) subsystem performs SD/MMC transactions to communicate with
     MMC, SD, SDHC, or SDIO devices inserted into the SD slot.

